   "pages": [
    47
   ],
   "taughtInClass": true,
   "tip": "To talk about the past, use the past tense: er becomes var (was/were) and laver becomes lavede (did/made). Add a time expression: Hvad lavede du i lørdags? Put a weekday and a time of day together to say when: lørdag aften, søndag eftermiddag, mandag morgen.",
